Vlaina RTC 0.1.0

Public source repository: https://github.com/vlaina-labs/vlaina-rtc

This source distribution contains networking libraries, the Eigen headers used
by TensorFlow Lite, and build integration used by the desktop application. It
contains no desktop business logic, facial recognition models, user data or
proprietary application assets.

The build integration and modifications to libdatachannel are made available
